      "content": "i don't really want to call the surgeon's office right now since they'll probably just tell me to come in and i'm trying to save money on the co-pay. it's not really painful, just tight and heavy. u think it's just fluid buildup from the surgery? can i just keep icing it and wait a few days to see if it goes down?",
